title: 엔딩납치_서은표_영문
---
<<bg 검은화면>>
<<bgm_stop>>
(......)
(I was... definitely at school just a moment ago.)
(It's not like I blacked out, but I have no memory of what just happened.)
(And now that I've opened my eyes...)
(I'm sitting in total darkness...)
(Are my arms and legs tied?)
(I can't move. Or maybe I just can't summon any strength.)
(I can barely even turn my head.)
(What on earth is this......)
(My mind is hazy with a mix of dread and exhaustion.)
(As I sit there dazed for a moment,)
(I hear the sound of footsteps... thud... thud...)
(......)
(Have I been kidnapped?)
(From the sound of it, someone is approaching, but I can't even see a silhouette.)
???: ......
???: Finally... you're staying still.
(This voice...)
<<show pyo_horror>>
EunPyo: {name()}......
{name()}: ??!
{name()}: EunPyo? What is the meaning of this...
(Perhaps because my mouth has been shut for so long, my voice comes out cracked.)
EunPyo: Why did you... have to do that?
EunPyo: It would have been so nice if you had just stayed with me.
<<show pyo_blush>>
EunPyo: Now, I can be with {name()} forever.
(I have no idea what any of this means.)
(I feel EunPyo's hand grip my chin.)
(I have no strength to resist.)
EunPyo: It was so hard watching you be with other people...
EunPyo: Don't go anywhere, okay?
<<hide>>
(My chin trembles uncontrollably. No words will come out.)
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
(I hear the faint sound of EunPyo's laughter.)
(Because she's so close, I can feel the heat radiating from her...)
<<bg 서은표_납치엔딩>>
EunPyo: I love you.
EunPyo: {name()}...
EunPyo: I
EunPyo: Love
EunPyo: You
ILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOU
ILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOUILOVEYOU
<<end>>
===